}}'''Heartblade''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the [[Heartblade Gamepass]] for 1,699 Robux. It is now only obtainable through trading as the [[Gamepasses|gamepass]] has went offsale. It was released February 20th, 2021. 

==Appearance==
Its blade is shiny silver in color with a red heart imprinted on it with swirly lines engraved beneath it. These lines divide the blade into two at the bottom, which between them is a light pink crystal. The edge of the blade is light pink the crystal. The guard is made up of a shiny bright red winged heart, and holding it together is a light pink prong beneath it. The handle, attached to the bottom of the prong, is silver with a diamond-cut design. Below the handle is the silver and light pink arrowhead pommel.
==Trivia==
*This gamepass came in replacement of the [[Cookieblade Gamepass]], only to be replaced by the [[Eggblade Gamepass]] only eleven days later.
*It is the first Valentine’s Day themed godly knife in [[Murder Mystery 2]], the second being [[Sakura]].
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].
*It was a victim of the [[The Duping Glitch (2022)|Duping Glitch (2022)]].
